# Send and recv on channel - sends "hello" and receives it back
# Use a pipeline: doc 1 sends/receives, doc 2 extracts the payload.
[
  ch:   [channel 10]
  sent: [send ch "hello"]
  msg:  [if [= sent []] [recv ch] [recv ch]]
]
---
[match %.msg
  [case [let v] [Result.Ok v] v]
  Closed.Closed:               "closed"]
=== out
String("hello")
